g\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Ore\">Ore</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">Refined</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">Forged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Ore\">?$/studs</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$234</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$268</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.4.4</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 16th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Greeb</b> is found in <a href=\"/wiki/Grimestone\" title=\"Grimestone\">Grimestone</a> and previously in <a href=\"/wiki/Marble\" title=\"Marble\">Marble</a>, pre the 1.37.0 update. It has a bright green color and a metallic material when refined. It can most easily be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Acid_Wastes\" title=\"Acid Wastes\">Acid Wastes</a> within Grimestone.\n</p><p>As of the most recent major update to Oaklands [<a href=\"/wiki/Version_1.17.0\" title=\"Version 1.17.0\">1.17.0</a>], Acidlands has been removed and replaced with the Icelands. The location of <a href=\"/wiki/Grimestone\" title=\"Grimestone\">Grimestone</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Uranium\" title=\"Uranium\">Uranium</a>, and <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Greeb</strong> have all been moved to <a href=\"/wiki/Mike%27s_Mines\" title=\"Mike&#39;s Mines\">Mike's Mines</a> behind a destructible wall near the entrance of the Farland's (according to the Mike's Mine map) as a temporary home.\n</p><p><b>Greeb</b> was a joke ore and originated in the community Discord. <i><b>Proudism</b></i>, a user in the community, had posted several fake pictures on 1/14/2023, Annual Greeb Day, of an \"unknown green ore\", which then started a chain of jokes and comments to add it to the game.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li><b>Greeb</b> is referenced in the description of the <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Alley\" title=\"Dark Alley\">Dark alley</a> vinyl disk.</li>\n<li><b>Greeb</b> can drop from goblins</li>\n<li><b>Greeb</b> features sound effects made by <b>Theofficialbrick</b>, in a video titled 'Oaklands Greeb Sound Audition'.</li>\n<li><b>Greeb</b> is the main focus point of the <a href=\"/wiki/Gift_of_Greeb\" title=\"Gift of Greeb\">Gift of Greeb</a>.</li>\n<li><b>Greeb</b> produces a much different sound when Refined or Forged, compared to most other materials.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz